WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.451
"The car wash stinks!" said Jeb.

2
00:00:08.452 --> 00:00:11.299
"This field trip is terrible!"

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.435
The car wash made loud sounds.

4
00:00:14.436 --> 00:00:19.058
Hiss! Wump! Wump! Wump!

5
00:00:19.059 --> 00:00:22.941
Poppy was quiet.

6
00:00:22.942 --> 00:00:31.834
She backed away from the building.

7
00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:39.723
"Everyone is dirty," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:39.724 --> 00:00:43.519
"I like dirt," said Jeb.

9
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.470
"Dirt feels good," said Eddy.

10
00:00:46.471 --> 00:00:49.032
Mr. Grill smiled.

11
00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.324
"I know you like dirt.

12
00:00:51.325 --> 00:00:58.154
But it's time to get clean."

13
00:00:58.155 --> 00:01:02.008
"I like to be clean," said Zippy.

14
00:01:02.009 --> 00:01:11.625
"It helps me go fast!"

15
00:01:11.626 --> 00:01:17.201
Mr. Grill looked at the students.

16
00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:22.749
"Who will go first?" he asked.

17
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.545
Eddy looked at Zippy.

18
00:01:26.546 --> 00:01:28.933
Then he looked at himself.

19
00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:46.996
He saw lots of dirt.

20
00:01:46.997 --> 00:01:52.498
Eddy wanted to be fast.

21
00:01:52.499 --> 00:02:00.603
He looked at Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:00.604 --> 00:02:06.456
"I'll go first," said Eddy.

